  Cell["Fit the energy range of interest", "Section"], Cell["If only bands near the Fermi energy are of interest, set \
EnergyWindow to the desired energy interval. Only reference energies in this interval enter the fit. The plot still \
shows the full bands, so changes outside the interval can also be seen.", "Text"], 
