  Cell["Fit near the K point", "Section"], Cell["To fit near K, set KPointNeighborhood to K and radius 0.15 in \
reciprocal fractional coordinates. Distances include periodic equivalents of k points. ComparisonPlot displays only \
this neighborhood: blue points are VASP, gray dashed curves are the initial model, and red curves are the fitted \
